# Deploy

Site publish is `pnpm ship` from the repo root (FilePress build, then Wrangler Pages project `detangler`). `site:deploy` is the same command.

Local preview is `pnpm site:dev`: LocalBerth lease `detangler-site` (preferred 5199), FilePress `--port` from that lease.

Agents must not run `npm publish` or `pnpm publish`.
